# 16. 2-of-3 Recovery

This is one of the most important parts of the product.

Generate:

```text
MASTER_KEY
```

Split it:

```text
MASTER_KEY
     │
     ▼
Shamir 2-of-3
     │
 ┌───┼───┐
 ▼   ▼   ▼
 A   B   C
```

### Share A

Primary device.

Store using:

```text
iOS Keychain / Secure Enclave
Android Keystore
```

### Share B

User recovery credential.

The user receives a human-friendly recovery mechanism.

Do not expose raw Shamir shares unless explicitly requested.

### Share C

Encrypted remote recovery share.

Store remotely.

It is harmless by itself because one share cannot reconstruct the master key.

---

# 17. Recovery Scenarios

### Scenario A — normal

```text
Primary Device + Remote Share
             ↓
       Recover key
```

### Scenario B — phone lost

```text
Recovery Credential
        +
Remote Share
        ↓
Reconstruct Master Key
        ↓
Register New Device
        ↓
Download encrypted files
        ↓
Decrypt locally
```

### Scenario C — cloud unavailable

```text
Primary Device
      +
Recovery Credential
      ↓
Recover account
```

### Scenario D — primary device and recovery credential lost

```text
Remote Share only
      ↓
Insufficient
      ↓
Data remains protected
```

This is intentional.

