# 20. File Sync State Machine

Implement a deterministic state machine.

```text
DISCOVERED
    │
    ▼
QUEUED
    │
    ▼
ENCRYPTING
    │
    ▼
CHUNKING
    │
    ▼
UPLOADING
    │
    ▼
VERIFYING
    │
    ▼
STORED
    │
    ▼
BACKED_UP
```

Failure:

```text
ANY STATE
   │
   ▼
FAILED
   │
   ▼
RETRY
   │
   └──────► previous state
```

Never lose the upload queue because the application restarts.

