# 41. End-to-End Acceptance Test

The AI agent must be able to execute this complete scenario.

```text
1. Install mobile application.

2. Create account using passkey.

3. Configure recovery.

4. Connect desktop.

5. Allocate 500 GB to personal storage.

6. Take photo on phone.

7. Verify photo enters sync queue.

8. Verify photo is encrypted.

9. Verify encrypted chunks reach desktop.

10. Verify desktop stores ciphertext.

11. Verify backend cannot decrypt the file.

12. Verify photo becomes visible on another authorized device.

13. Disconnect desktop.

14. Take another photo.

15. Verify photo remains queued.

16. Reconnect desktop.

17. Verify synchronization resumes automatically.

18. Delete/revoke primary phone.

19. Install application on new phone.

20. Recover account using two recovery components.

21. Verify previously backed-up photos are accessible.

22. Verify revoked phone cannot access new data.

23. Verify encrypted remote backup can restore the account.
```

The entire sequence must pass before calling the MVP production-ready.

